{
    "title": "Remodel AI - Home Renovation",
    "description": "<h2><b>Remodel AI - Home Renovation</b></h2> is your own personal AI home designer with Interior design, exterior home design, remodeling and much more! Use artificial intelligence to visualize your home design & home remodel in various styles. Take photos of your home and instantly see a fully remodeled version, new flooring, different walls, new landscaping, and more. Choose from many different interior design styles and architecture styles.\r\n\r\nOur user-friendly app harnesses the power of artificial intelligence to provide you with intuitive tools and personalized recommendations tailored to your unique preferences and style. Whether you're dreaming of a complete home renovation, using a room planner, or simply looking to redecorate a room, our easy-to-use AI interior design and remodeling features make it effortless to bring your vision to life!\r\n\r\nReimagine exterior home design, interior decorating & remodeling with these key features:\r\n<h2><b>AI INTERIOR DESIGN & REMODELING</b></h2>\r\nExperience the future of interior design with our AI-powered features. From reimagining room layouts to selecting the perfect color palette, our intelligent algorithms help you visualize and execute your home interior design ideas with precision and ease.\r\n\r\n<h2><b>EXTERIOR HOME DESIGN & LANDSCAPING</b></h2>\r\nTransform your outdoor space with confidence using our exterior home design and landscaping tools. From adding curb appeal with new siding and roofing options to creating lush garden retreats, our app empowers you to enhance the beauty and functionality of your home's exterior.\r\n\r\n<h2><b>RESKIN, REPLACE & REDECORATE</b></h2>\r\nRevitalize your space with our reskin, replace, repaint and redecorate features. Whether you're looking to update your furniture, swap out decor accents, or refresh your walls with a new coat of paint, our app makes it simple to make changes and see instant results.\r\n\r\n<h2><b>INTERIOR & EXTERIOR EDITOR</b></h2>\r\nTake control of your home's transformation with our comprehensive interior and exterior editors. Customize every aspect of your space with the selective brush, from flooring and furniture placement to outdoor landscaping and architectural details, with our advanced editing tools for house design\r\n\r\n<h2><b>INSTANT TRANSFORMATION</b></h2>\r\nSee your design ideas come to life in an instant with our instant transformation feature. With just a few clicks experiment with different looks and styles until you find the perfect one\r\n\r\n<h2><b>PAINT EXPLORER</b></h2>\r\nIt is your ultimate tool for discovering the perfect paint colors. Visualize, match, and explore shades effortlessly with AI-powered features. Transform your space with ease and precision!\r\n\r\n<h2><b>SAVE & SHARE</b></h2>\r\nCapture and share your design inspirations with our save and share functionality. Save your favorite designs for future reference or share them with friends, family, or professionals for feedback and collaboration. With our app, collaboration has never been easier\r\n\r\nWith our intuitive room planner and redecorating features, you can experiment with different layouts and decor options until you find the perfect combination. And when you're ready to start your renovation project, our app provides you with all the tools and resources you need to turn your vision into reality\r\n\r\nWhether you're a seasoned DIYer or a first-time homeowner, our app is your ultimate partner in home design and renovation. Download now and discover the endless possibilities for transforming your space with AI technology. With our app, the only limit is your imagination.\r\n\r\nEnvision all the possibilities to discover what you like and plan your remodel! \r\n\r\nDon't wait any longer to create the home of your dreams. Download our AI-powered home remodel and renovation app today and start designing your ideal space!\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://remodelai.app/privacy-policy\r\nTerms & Conditions: https://remodelai.app/terms-conditions\r\n[Minimum supported app version: 0.6.0]",
    "descriptionHTML": "<h2><b>Remodel AI - Home Renovation</b></h2> is your own personal AI home designer with Interior design, exterior home design, remodeling and much more! Use artificial intelligence to visualize your home design &amp; home remodel in various styles. Take photos of your home and instantly see a fully remodeled version, new flooring, different walls, new landscaping, and more. Choose from many different interior design styles and architecture styles.<br><br>Our user-friendly app harnesses the power of artificial intelligence to provide you with intuitive tools and personalized recommendations tailored to your unique preferences and style. Whether you&#39;re dreaming of a complete home renovation, using a room planner, or simply looking to redecorate a room, our easy-to-use AI interior design and remodeling features make it effortless to bring your vision to life!<br><br>Reimagine exterior home design, interior decorating &amp; remodeling with these key features:<br><h2><b>AI INTERIOR DESIGN &amp; REMODELING</b></h2><br>Experience the future of interior design with our AI-powered features. From reimagining room layouts to selecting the perfect color palette, our intelligent algorithms help you visualize and execute your home interior design ideas with precision and ease.<br><br><h2><b>EXTERIOR HOME DESIGN &amp; LANDSCAPING</b></h2><br>Transform your outdoor space with confidence using our exterior home design and landscaping tools. From adding curb appeal with new siding and roofing options to creating lush garden retreats, our app empowers you to enhance the beauty and functionality of your home&#39;s exterior.<br><br><h2><b>RESKIN, REPLACE &amp; REDECORATE</b></h2><br>Revitalize your space with our reskin, replace, repaint and redecorate features. Whether you&#39;re looking to update your furniture, swap out decor accents, or refresh your walls with a new coat of paint, our app makes it simple to make changes and see instant results.<br><br><h2><b>INTERIOR &amp; EXTERIOR EDITOR</b></h2><br>Take control of your home&#39;s transformation with our comprehensive interior and exterior editors. Customize every aspect of your space with the selective brush, from flooring and furniture placement to outdoor landscaping and architectural details, with our advanced editing tools for house design<br><br><h2><b>INSTANT TRANSFORMATION</b></h2><br>See your design ideas come to life in an instant with our instant transformation feature. With just a few clicks experiment with different looks and styles until you find the perfect one<br><br><h2><b>PAINT EXPLORER</b></h2><br>It is your ultimate tool for discovering the perfect paint colors. Visualize, match, and explore shades effortlessly with AI-powered features. Transform your space with ease and precision!<br><br><h2><b>SAVE &amp; SHARE</b></h2><br>Capture and share your design inspirations with our save and share functionality. Save your favorite designs for future reference or share them with friends, family, or professionals for feedback and collaboration. With our app, collaboration has never been easier<br><br>With our intuitive room planner and redecorating features, you can experiment with different layouts and decor options until you find the perfect combination. And when you&#39;re ready to start your renovation project, our app provides you with all the tools and resources you need to turn your vision into reality<br><br>Whether you&#39;re a seasoned DIYer or a first-time homeowner, our app is your ultimate partner in home design and renovation. Download now and discover the endless possibilities for transforming your space with AI technology. With our app, the only limit is your imagination.<br><br>Envision all the possibilities to discover what you like and plan your remodel! <br><br>Don&#39;t wait any longer to create the home of your dreams. Download our AI-powered home remodel and renovation app today and start designing your ideal space!<br><br>Privacy Policy: https://remodelai.app/privacy-policy<br>Terms &amp; Conditions: https://remodelai.app/terms-conditions<br>[Minimum supported app version: 0.6.0]",
